# Strava Configuration (Optional - for Strava integration)
# Get these values by creating a Strava API application at:
# https://www.strava.com/settings/api
#
# VITE_STRAVA_CLIENT_ID: Your Strava application's Client ID
# STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET: Your Strava application's Client Secret (add this to Supabase Secrets)
# VITE_STRAVA_REDIRECT_URI: OAuth callback URL (should be your-domain/strava/callback)
#
# Note: STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET should be stored in Supabase Secrets, not in .env
# Use the Supabase dashboard to add it: Settings > Edge Functions > Secrets

